<li>responsive breakpoint variants supported for both row and column gaps (e.g. <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">xs: &quot;medium&quot;, md: &quot;xlarge&quot;</span></span></code></span>) to replace repeated child margin utilities</li>
