<h3 class="bold" id="changed-24"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="changelog#changed-24">Changed</a></h3>
<ul>
<li>Updated <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">Icon</span></span></code></span> component&#x27;s <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">.icon--with-text-end</span></span></code></span> modifier to use <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">margin-inline-start</span></span></code></span> and <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">margin-inline-end</span></span></code></span> for better support of different writing modes and text directions, ensuring proper spacing between the icon and adjacent text regardless of layout direction.</li>
<li><span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">Tooltip</span></span></code></span> component trigger activation behavior changed to require explicit user action (click/tap or keyboard activation) to show the tooltip, instead of showing on hover/focus. Tooltip now remains open until the trigger is activated again, the user presses <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">Esc</span></span></code></span>, or clicks/taps outside of the trigger and tooltip dialog. This change improves accessibility and usability, especially on touch devices where hover is not available, and allows users to interact with tooltip content without it disappearing unexpectedly.</li>
</ul>
