<li>Fixed paddings in <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">Table</span></span></code></span> component</li>
<li>Fixed accessibility issue in <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">Megamenu</span></span></code></span> and <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">MegamenuBlog</span></span></code></span> mobile panels where <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">aria-hidden</span></span></code></span> could be applied while a descendant still retained focus; focus is now restored to a safe external trigger before panel hide/switch to prevent browser warnings and assistive-technology conflicts</li>
<li>Refactored Forms search icon markup to wrapper-based rendering for autofill-safe behavior: <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">TextInput</span></span></code></span> uses <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">.text-input__wrapper--search-icon-with-placeholder</span></span></code></span> and <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">Autocomplete</span></span></code></span> uses <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">.autocomplete__wrapper--search-icon-with-placeholder</span></span></code></span> (icon rendered via wrapper pseudo-element)</li>
<li>Updated <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">TextInput</span></span></code></span> HTML structure for search-icon variants by wrapping the <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token code-tag punctuation" style="color:hsl(119, 34%, 47%)">&lt;</span><span class="token code-tag" style="color:hsl(5, 74%, 59%)">input</span><span class="token code-tag punctuation" style="color:hsl(119, 34%, 47%)">&gt;</span></span></code></span> in a dedicated wrapper element</li>
<li>Refactored <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">Megamenu</span></span></code></span> search input markup to wrapper-based rendering: search icon and responsive width behavior are now applied through <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">.megamenu__input-wrapper</span></span></code></span> modifiers instead of input modifiers, keeping icon rendering independent from input autofill/background behavior</li>
<li>Fixed Megamenu search icon vertical alignment by moving spacing responsibility from input margin to wrapper layout, so icon centering stays aligned with the input control</li>
</ul>
