<h3 class="bold" id="removed-40"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="changelog#removed-40">Removed</a></h3>
<ul>
<li>Removed <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">colorScheme</span></span></code></span> prop from all components (Alert, Accordion, AnchorNavigation, Breadcrumbs, Button, Carousel, CarouselHero, CarouselPromotions, Controls, Expander, FeatureAccordion, Hero, InputStepper, Link, Modal, Pagination, Pill, PromoBanner, PromotionCard, Stepbar, Table, Tabs, Tooltip) — className-based styling with CSS tokens is now the standard approach</li>
<li>Removed <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">background</span></span></code></span> prop from <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">Hero</span></span></code></span> component — use CSS custom properties for color customization</li>
<li>Removed legacy color constant exports from <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">color.scss</span></span></code></span> (replaced with semantic light/dark theme tokens)</li>
</ul>
